== Overview ==
The '''UFO Toilet''' is a [[Enemies|enemy]] that appears in [[Hard Mode]] and [[Nightmare Mode]]. It appears in Wave 49 of [[Hard Mode]]. It can stun units with its cannon every 1 second and has another ability that makes it go invisible for 2 seconds. When it is invisible, [[units]] can still attack it, however, it will not suffer any damage. It can still stun units while being invisible, making this enemy quite hard to beat.

